  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 710.09 Monitoring and Compliance Requirements for Beta Particle and Photon Radioactivity for Vulnerable Systems",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 710.09 Monitoring and Compliance Requirements for Beta Particle and Photon Radioactivity for Vulnerable Systems. To determine compliance with the MCLs in Env-Dw 703.03 for beta particle and photon radioactivity, the CWS O/O shall comply with 40 CFR 141.26(b).\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
